.TH PLEB-PLANT-GROWER 6 "2026-08-10" "0.1.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
pleb-plant-grower \- a realtime houseplant you actually have to look after
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pleb-plant-grower
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Plants grow on the wall clock rather than a turn counter. Close the game for a
week and a week of care, or neglect, has happened when you return.
.PP
Runs standalone in a terminal, or embedded in kilix-land. In standalone the
backdrop scene may be swapped or disabled.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 2
Unrecognised option.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kilix-land (6)
